under PMAY on Turnkey basis at plot at S. No. 392/1/A Bolinj, Virar Tal. Vasai, Dist. Palghar.\n\nLocation : S. No. 392/1/A Bolinj, Virar Tal. Vasai, Dist. Palghar\n\nType of Schemes: EWS Tenements.\n\nTotal no. of tenements proposed:  \n328 EWS Tenements (Total 2 bldgs.)\n\nCarpet area:  \nEWS Type T/S = 29.99 Sqm i.e. 322.81 Sq.ft.\n\nRooms per tenements: EWS - 1 BHK (Bed, Multipurpose Room (Hall), Kitchen & W/C, Bath)\n\nCurrent status: Building work is completed and OC obtained on 29.02.2024\n\nAmenities to be provided in the Tenements.","score":0.64719695,"raw_content":null,"id":"f24691-06"},{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/mhadaofficial/videos/mhada-has-introduced-an-exceptional-housing-project-in-powai-specially-designed-/1052198979626972","title":"MHADA Powai housing project for middle- income group lottery","content":"This development will also offer a range of luxurious amenities, including a grand lobby, gym, clubhouse, yoga center, and much more. The \"","score":0.575517,"raw_content":null,"id":"041131-07"}],"response_time":3.74,"request_id":"b0b38c76-48ba-4a9d-bf46-2bace04d9992"}